  "designRules": [
    "Three additive handgun variants; every existing weapon and every Nameless-exclusive output remains unchanged.",
    "Exactly three new dedicated matching ammunition IDs and material-only recipes; no existing or enchanted gun is consumed.",
    "Native combo state may restart at the right hand after idle, reload or swapping; hand parity is not a promised persistent property.",
    "All three retain the shared handgun traveled-path falloff curve, native class/enchantment hooks and once-per-discharge ammunition refund.",
    "F/Use reload keeps block/entity interaction precedence and leaves H available for class abilities.",
    "Only the paired Luminia Legendary adds a Q: one projectile, two rounds, twelve-second shared lock, native mark/slow immunity rules.",
    "All firearm/ability audio is reused through new named sound-event aliases; no duplicate owner and world playback is introduced.",
    "Native Chaining validates/selects a hand branch before that branch consumes one round and triggers cooldown. Failed inputs may alter transient combo order; hand sequence is not saved. Persistent magazine metadata is shared by both rendered pistols."
  ],
  "namelessExclusivesUnchanged": true,
  "version": "2.1.0"
}
